.jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241555215895198.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241553171160870.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Copper Motor:<br/><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241556469044702.jpg\"/> <br/>·Pure copper make it more efficient <br/>·50Hz or 60Hz can be designed</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Various Choices: <br/><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241556558023026.jpg\"/> <br/>·Stainless steel / Copper / Iron available for outlet, suction chamber and oil chamber</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Pump Shaft:<br/><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241557144378852.jpg\"/> <br/>·Much stronger, no distortion (especially for the longer pumps)</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Bearing:<br/><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241557244044207.jpg\"/> <br/>·Material: C&amp;U<br/>·Better balance and less noise</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Control Box:     <br/><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241557346594586.jpg\"/> <br/>·Protecting the motor from burned down<br/>·Fire-resistant material casing</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"284\"><p>Cable:<br/><img alt=\"image020(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241557431558818.jpg\"/> <br/>·Durable material last longer<br/>·Cable produced &amp; qualified by JIADI</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Company profile </strong></p><p><strong>History:</strong> More than 25 years experience of manufacturing pumps.</p><p><strong>Scale:</strong> Cover working area of 99900 square meters, have more than 300 employees.</p><p><strong>Technology:</strong> A group of professional technical engineers and a strong R&amp;D team.</p><p><strong>Management: </strong>Stringent management and strict quality control system.</p><p><strong>Innovation:</strong> Continuously diversify products range to satisfy customers’ needs.</p><p><strong>Production capacity:</strong> 100,000 pcs/month; Marketing network; Europe, Asia, Africa, etc.</p><p><strong>Marketing mode:</strong> All export business. </p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241558508822840.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image022(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Application</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241558546024855.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image024(001).jpg\"/></p><p>·Multistage submersible water pumps with stainless steel impeller conceived in order to solve any problem of clean water conveyance.</p><p>·Suitable for irrigation, and pressure systems and pressure systems and generally for civil and industrial purposes.</p><p>·For water supply from wells or reservoirs, domestic use, civil and industrial applications and for garden use and irrigation.</p><p><strong>6. Our services</strong></p><p>Sample service : Sample ,we can supply as customer specify requires , and customer need take the EXPESS and sample cost .</p><p>Customized Service: 1.Accept OEM  2. 1 YEARS warranty from ETD  3. Promise that we will produce the quality products and meet the customer requires.</p><p>After sale service: 1.During the warranty time can replace a new one.   2. Our engineer and sales team can visit our core agent for promotion</p><p><strong>7. Certificates</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241411154549302.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><table><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"248\">ISO14001</td><td align=\"center\" style=\"\" valign=\"middle\